  <biography>k__BackingField: "A witch from a distant village who deceived its people
    with false promises of\r\nhelp. Though she possessed genuine magical abilities,
    she chose to use them selfishly, merely pretending to aid those in need. When
    her lies were finally exposed, she was cast out of the village. Before her exile,
    however, she committed a cruel act, poisoning the village\u2019s only source
    of water. After leaving, she soon met an unavoidable fate, as she was unable
    to defend herself against wild beasts."
